(1120, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 50, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Portable Neck Fan', 'portable-neck-fan', 1000, 690.00, 380.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Product Name :-&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>[Cooling &amp; Safe]The est designed portable hanging neck fan, with 48 wind outlets and 60pcs twin-turbine fan blades, multiplies wind power and can quickly feel cool in 3s. Bladeless neck fans can be used safely by children and the elderly. And you don&#39;t worry about getting your hair in. The neck fan will keep you cool always.<br />\r\n[Free Your Hands &amp; Fashion]Hand free neck fan was designed to look like a headphone, you can free your hands and have a fashion style. The hanging neck fan is lightweight and portable, you can take it anywhere. Can Be Suitable For Outdoor Sports, Indoor Exercises, Offices, Gym, Travelling, And Camping.<br />\r\n[USB Rechargeable &amp; 3 Speed Wind]USB rechargeable fan, convenient to charge via computer, cell phone charger, power bank, laptop, etc. Built-in 1800 mAh battery provides 2.5 to 7 working hours duration (depending on different speeds). 3 wind speeds can be adjusted at will to meet any needs of you.<br />\r\n[Low Noise Design &amp; Comfortable]The wearable personal fan&#39;s motor has been modified so that will produce lower noise during operation. Made of Eco-friendly ABS. Makes the hands-free neckband fan softer and more durable and quieter. Even if you wear a neck fan, you can have a quiet environment.<br />\r\n[Enjoy &amp; Service]Wear our hanging neck fan, you can be freer, more comfortable, more fashionable, and enjoy the coolness of summer everywhere and anytime.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color: white , Green &amp; Pink&nbsp;<br />\r\nMaterial: ABS+PC<br />\r\nSize: 22.2x20.7x5.8cm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Only the above package content, and other products are not included.<br />\r\nNote: displays may cause the color of the item in the picture a little different from the real thing. The measurement allowed err