(1130, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 55, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Electric Panci Non-stick Mini Rice Cooker', 'electric-panci-non-stick-mini-rice-cooker', 1000, 1190.00, 730.00, NULL, 730.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h3><strong>Product Summary &amp; Specification</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>This mini electric rice cooker is a versatile kitchen appliance that can be used to cook a variety of dishes, including rice, soup, noodles, hot pot, and even eggs. It has a capacity of 500gm, which is enough to feed 1-2 people. The cooker has two adjustable temperature controls, so you can cook your food to your desired doneness. It also has a transparent glass lid, so you can see your food cooking without having to open the cooker.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Full Specification :&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Product Type : Rice Cooker</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Voltage : 220V</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Power : 300W-600W</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Capacity : 500 gm</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Steam rack large enough to fit up to 7 Eggs/Momo Can be Cook, Fry, Steam, Boil Easy to use</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Material : Stainless steel PP</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Voltage 220V 50Hz/Power 350W</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/985ced8de901829ad5c47e56af401dca.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/fa5589a97b644ca0eb74133b743b7bb2.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/bccaa086c55c7726736994fc3c664251.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/01c7e6c4e4acc1153937a44480012b4f.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/5dedeffaa88c476cf4090a4092068cca.png_2200x2200q80.png_.webp\" /></p>', NULL, '664812197pro_mainElectric Panci Non-stick Mini Rice Cooker.webp', 'https://backend.droploo.com/product/images/664812197pro_mainElectric Panci Non-stick Mini Rice Co