(1156, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 55, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Multifunctional 2 In 1 Egg Opener', 'multifunctional-2-in-1-egg-opener', 1000, 790.00, 390.00, NULL, 390.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Product Details :-&nbsp;</strong>Fast and efficient separation</p>\r\n\r\n<p>in one step of egg beats and egg whites</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/2022/11/feefaf41b537eb9073ac6e0ad0f819bc70c9515ff5436782fc6ac1e0883027c3.gif\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Features</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>【EASY TO USE】There is an egg holder under the egg opener, just simply put egg or duck egg on the holder, squeeze the egg cracking tool to break the eggshell, then separate the eggshell opener to make sure egg yolk and white filter by egg white separator.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/95d13e84d0feb94c9d2272a8ba6796a7c3300b15.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>【QUICKER SEPARATE EGG WHITE AND EGG YOLK AFTER IMPROVED DESIGN】Unlike other traditional egg separator tool with 2 holes, our egg extractor upgraded streamlined 3 hole hollow design which allows egg yolks whites fully separate for baking and cooking needs. Note: shaking slowly will get quicker separate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/9a76ed8a6ef6dd830769bb951b9197b79c56a5c2.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>【NO KITCHEN MESS &amp; NO DIRTY HANDS】Our creative egg gadgets tool combines the function of egg cracker and egg separator, eggshell cutter can crack eggshell without causing kitchen mess or shell pieces and can quickly open eggs or duck eggs not dirty hands.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/36e2b1f5bc0dbef9936ca065498d73bde1f8a370.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>【SAVE TIME AND EFFORT】Our egg separator tool can help you to improve cooking efficiency if you need to crack a lot of eggs. Egg cutter is an essential cooking baker tool for home bakers and commercial kitchens alike. Great to use at home or in restaurant.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/e2aaf31a6db391c0d48ebd2b2022e56d7b672a0e.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>【SUS 304 FOOD GRADE STAINLESS STEEL &amp; DISHWASHER SAFE】Our eggshell cracker is made of SUS 304 food grade stainless steel material, comfortable ABS hand grip, stable egg holder and high quality spring, no rusting, durable and safe. Dishwasher-safe, easy to clean.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://cdn.techcloudly.com/image/ce57e7edf548e7c2a697a117f9a3435134673069.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications :-</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Material: Food grade ABS + food grade</li>\r\n	<li>Color: Grey</li>\r\n	<li>Product size: 21.9*10cm</li>\r\n	<li>Product weight: 145g</li>\r\n	<li>Weight with color box: 189g (including egg white separator)</li>\r\n	<li>Package content : 1 x multi-functional egg opener 2 in 1 + 1 x egg white separato</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '545715782pro_mainMultifunctional 2 In 1 Egg Opener.webp', 'https://backend.droploo.com/product/images/545715782pro_mainMultifunctional 2 In 1 Egg Opener.webp', 'feature', 1, '2025-07-03 12:44:20', '2025-07-07 11:02:06', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন।<br />\r\nব্যবহার করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।<br />\r\nCall Us: +8801857584348</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>​​​​​​​Email: contact@droploo.com</strong></p>', NULL, 0, 40, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1157, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 51, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nasal Breathing Dilator', 'nasal-breathing-dilator', 1000, 790.00, 370.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ul>\r\n	<li>PATENTED TECHNOLOGY - Patented two-part nasal dilator uses dual strips and a magnetic band to maximize airflow, opening nasal passages for optimal breathing. Its innovative design ensures a personalized and comfortable fit for every user.</li>\r\n	<li>COMFORTABLE &amp; DURABLE - Comfortable and durable, the external relief band avoids nose bridge pressure, offering a more effective, lasting solution than traditional nasal strips or sprays, ensuring a superior and comfortable experience for users.</li>\r\n	<li>REDUCES SNORING - Safe and effective anti-snore device improves nasal airflow, reduces snoring, and enhances sleep quality for you and your partner. Boost oxygen levels, reduce stress, and increase energy for better performance and daily vitality.</li>\r\n	<li>SAFE &amp; EFFECTIVE - Nasal dilators pair well with nasal sprays and neti pots for congestion relief and snoring reduction. Safe, drug-free, and latex-free, they&rsquo;re doctor-recommended as the top anti-mouth breathing and anti-snoring solution.</li>\r\n	<li>EASY TO USE - The Snoring Aid Starter Kits include everything you need: four reusable relief bands in different sizes for a perfect fit, 15 or 15single-use nose breathing strips, and a magnetic applicator for easy application.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '1359972185pro_mainNasal Breathing Dilator.webp', 'https://backend.droploo.com/product/images/1359972185pro_mainNasal Breathing Dilator.webp', 'feature', 1, '2025-07-03 12:47:56', '2025-08-10 13:08:31', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন।<br />\r\nব্যবহার করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।<br />\r\nCall Us: +8801857584348</strong></p>', NULL, 0, 41, NULL, NULL, 5),
