(1182, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'DT900 ULTRA 9 Smart Watch', 'dt900-ultra-9-smart-watch', 1000, 1990.00, 1140.00, NULL, 1140.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Affordable</li>\r\n	<li>Large, bright display</li>\r\n	<li>Heart rate monitoring</li>\r\n	<li>Blood oxygen monitoring</li>\r\n	<li>Sleep tracking</li>\r\n	<li>Step counting</li>\r\n	<li>Water resistance</li>\r\n	<li>Bluetooth calling</li>\r\n	<li>Music control</li>\r\n	<li>Heart rate monitoring: The DT 900 Ultra can track your heart rate 24/7, so you can see how active you are and how well your heart is functioning.</li>\r\n	<li>Blood oxygen monitoring: This feature can be used to measure the amount of oxygen in your blood, which can be helpful for tracking your overall health.</li>\r\n	<li>Sleep tracking: The DT 900 Ultra can track your sleep patterns, so you can see how much sleep you&rsquo;re getting and how well you&rsquo;re sleeping.</li>\r\n	<li>Step counting: This feature can help you track your daily steps and keep motivated to reach your fitness goals.</li>\r\n	<li>Water resistance: The DT 900 Ultra is water resistant up to 5ATM, so you can wear it in the shower or pool.</li>\r\n	<li>Bluetooth calling: The DT 900 Ultra can make and receive calls directly from your wrist, so you don&rsquo;t have to take your phone out of your pocket.</li>\r\n	<li>Music control: You can use the DT 900 Ultra to control music playback on your phone.</li>\r\n	<li>Other features: The DT 900 Ultra also has a built-in camera, alarm clock, and calendar.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '1308043272pro_mainDT900 ULTRA 9 Smart Watch.webp', 'https://backend.droploo.com/product/images/1308043272pro_mainDT900 ULTRA 9 Smart Watch.webp', 'feature', 1, '2025-07-08 06:49:39', '2025-07-08 06:49:41', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন।</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><