(1188, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 51, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Electronic Smart Postuer Corrector', 'electronic-smart-postuer-corrector', 1000, 850.00, 310.00, 750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" /><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Adjustable Strap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our posture corrector uses a high-elastic nylon belt for better elasticity and more comfort.It is breathable and not sultry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wide Application</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The back brace is suitable for a wide range of people.It can help children correct their studying postures and helps adults relieve pain. Making your family &rsquo;s lives healthier.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Long Battery Life</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The back corrector uses a 500mAh polymer lithium battery and can be used for about 15 days after 2 hours charging, it is easy to charge by connecting USB cable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our postures corrector does wonder!</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Make your feel confident and younger</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Recover mobility and strengthen the muscles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Realign your vertebrae to their proper position.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Eliminate upper and lower back pain, neck pain.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Minimize stress and bring more calm into your life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Reduce slouching, hunching and slumping by correcting your posture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How to works ?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.&nbsp;Wear it&nbsp; according to the picture below<br />\r\n2. Press the middle switch<br />\r\n3. When the body is tilted more than 25 degrees, the sensor will vibrate to remind you to correct your posture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" /></p>', NULL, '1081769364pro_mainElectronic Smart Postuer Corrector.webp', 'https://backend.droploo.com/product/images/1081769364pro_mainElectronic Smart Postuer Corrector.webp', 'feature', 1, '2025-07-15 09:39:09', '2025-07-15 09:39:11', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"tel:01648177071\"><strong>Call Us:</strong>&nbsp;+8801857584348 </a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:banggomartbd@gmail.com\"><strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;contact@droploo.com </a></p>', NULL, 0, 71, NULL, NULL, 5);
