all rejection</li>\r\n			<li>Dial pad</li>\r\n			<li>Recent call</li>\r\n			<li>Contact</li>\r\n			<li>AI voice</li>\r\n		</ul>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li>Health and Fitness Tracking\r\n		<ul>\r\n			<li>24-hour heart rate monitor</li>\r\n			<li>SPO2 blood oxygen monitor</li>\r\n			<li>Pedometer</li>\r\n			<li>Abnormal heart rate alerts</li>\r\n			<li>Blood pressure monitor</li>\r\n			<li>Activity tracker</li>\r\n			<li>Sleep monitor</li>\r\n			<li>Stress monitor</li>\r\n			<li>Breathing training</li>\r\n			<li>Detects altitude</li>\r\n		</ul>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li>Smart Notifications\r\n		<ul>\r\n			<li>Call, text and smartphone app notifications</li>\r\n			<li>Weather sync</li>\r\n			<li>Controls smartphone music and camera</li>\r\n			<li>Find my phone</li>\r\n			<li>Do not disturb modes</li>\r\n			<li>Sedentary alert</li>\r\n			<li>Shake snapshot</li>\r\n			<li>Games</li>\r\n		</ul>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li>Sports Modes\r\n		<ul>\r\n			<li>Over 100 sports modes for tracking workouts</li>\r\n		</ul>\r\n		</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>Language\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>English, French, Portuguese, Russian, India, Turkey, Poland, Arabia, Persia</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>Operating System: IOS 9.0 and above Android 5.0 and above</li>\r\n	<li>Others\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Loudspeaker: Yes</li>\r\n		<li>Microphone: Yes</li>\r\n		<li>Vibrator: Yes</li>\r\n		<li>Waterproof level: IP67</li>\r\n		<li>Apps: New wear</li>\r\n		<li>Made in China</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>Battery\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Standby time: 65 days</li>\r\n		<li>Usage time: About 7 days</li>\r\n		<li>Charging Method: Two-pin magnetic charging</li>\r\n		<li>Charging Time: Approx. 2 hours</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>In The Box&nbsp;\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>1 x Smartwatch</li>\r\n		<li>1 x Silicon Strap</li>\r\n		<li>1 x &nbsp;Charging Cable</li>\r\n		<li>1 x User Manual</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Description</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>This TF10 pro smartwatch has Bluetooth V5.2 connectivity that offers a seamless 