(1548, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 50, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SY-322 Multifunctional Wireless Stereo Speaker with LED Flashlight', 'sy-322-multifunctional-wireless-stereo-speaker-with-led-flashlight', 99, 1350.00, 850.00, 1150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h2>📝 Product Description</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>এই SY-322 একটি মাল্টিফাংশনাল ডিভাইস, যেখানে তুমি একসাথে পাবে শক্তিশালী LED ফ্ল্যাশলাইট এবং হাই-কোয়ালিটি ওয়্যারলেস স্পিকার। এটি আউটডোর ট্রাভেল, ক্যাম্পিং, লোডশেডিং বা ইমার্জেন্সি পরিস্থিতিতে খুবই উপযোগী।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>এতে রয়েছে সুপার ব্রাইট LED লাইট এবং ক্লিয়ার সাউন্ড কোয়ালিটির স্পিকার, যা মোবাইল বা অন্য ডিভাইসের সাথে সহজেই কানেক্ট করা যায়।</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>✨ Key Features</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔊 Wireless Stereo Speaker (Bluetooth Support)</li>\r\n	<li>🔦 Super Bright LED Flashlight</li>\r\n	<li>🔋 Rechargeable Battery (USB Charging)</li>\r\n	<li>📱 Mobile / Tablet Support</li>\r\n	<li>🎵 HiFi Sound Quality</li>\r\n	<li>🎛️ Built-in Control Buttons (Volume, Mode, Power)</li>\r\n	<li>🧳 Portable &amp; Lightweight Design</li>\r\n	<li>🔌 USB Charging Cable Included</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>⚙️ Specifications</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Model:</strong> SY-322</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Type:</strong> Multifunctional Speaker + Flashlight</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Wireless (Bluetooth)</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Light Type:</strong> LED</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Charging:</strong> USB Rechargeable</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Material:</strong> Durable Plastic Body</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Color:</strong> Black (with White Ends)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>📦 Package Includes</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 &times; SY-322 Wireless Speaker Flashlight</li>\r\n	<li>1 &times; USB Charging Cable</li>\r\n	<li>1 &times; Wrist Strap</li>\r\n	<li>1 &times; Product Box</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>🎯 Usage</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏕️ Camping &amp; Outdoor Activities</li>\r\n	<li>🌙 Emergency Lighting (Load Shedding)</li>\r\n	<li>🎶 Music Listening Anywhere</li>\r\n	<li>🚶 Travel Companion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>💡 Why Choose This Product?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>একসাথে লাইট + স্পিকার</li>\r\n	<li>চার্জেবল, তাই বারবার ব্যাটারি বদলানোর ঝামেলা নেই</li>\r\n	<li>সহজে বহনযোগ্য</li>\r\n	<li>আউটডোর ও ইমার্জেন্সির জন্য পারফেক্ট</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>⚠️ Note</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>ব্যবহারের আগে সম্পূর্ণ চার্জ করুন</li>\r\n	<li>পানিতে সরাসরি ব্যবহার না করার পরামর্শ দেওয়া হচ্ছে</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '603113326_pro_main_sy_322_multifunctional_wireless_stereo_speaker_with_led_flashlight.webp', 'https://backend.droploo.com/product/images/603113326_pro_main_sy_322_multifunctional_wireless_stereo_speaker_with_led_flashlight.webp', 'feature', 1, '2026-04-10 17:39:18', '2026-04-12 13:55:05', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"tel:01648177071\"><strong>Call Us:</strong>&nbsp;</a><a href=\"tel:+8801754177162\">+8801335157755</a></p>', NULL, 0, 1176, NULL, NULL, 5),
(1549, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 50, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Butterfly Mini Massager', 'butterfly-mini-massager', 2, 790.00, 450.00, 650.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>A mini massager is a small, portable handheld device designed to provide massage therapy for relaxation and muscle tension relief. It is typically compact, lightweight, and easy to use, making it suitable for on-the-go use and targeting specific areas of the body.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Key Features of a Mini Massager:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Compact and Portable: The mini massager is small in size, making it easy to carry in a bag or purse for use anytime, anywhere.</li>\r\n	<li>Handheld Design: It is designed to be held in the hand, allowing the user to control the massage pressure and target specific areas of the body.</li>\r\n	<li>Vibration or Percussion Massage: The massager may use vibration or percussion technology to provide gentle or more intense massage sensations.</li>\r\n	<li>Battery-operated: Many mini massagers are powered by batteries, ensuring cordless and convenient use without the need for a power outlet.</li>\r\n	<li>On/Off Switch: The massager usually has a simple on/off switch or button for easy operation.</li>\r\n	<li>Multiple Attachments: Some models may come with interchangeable massage heads or attachments to offer different massage sensations.</li>\r\n	<li>Versatile Use: It can be used on various body parts, such as the neck, shoulders, back, arms, legs, and feet, to relieve muscle tension and promote relaxation.</li>\r\n	<li>Lightweight and Quiet: The massager is often designed to be lightweight and quiet, ensuring a comfortable and discreet massage experience.</li>\r\n	<li>Massage Intensity Control: Certain mini massagers have adjustable speed settings to customize the massage intensity according to personal preference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Important Considerations:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Personal Comfort: Choose a mini massager with massage techniques and intensity levels that suit your comfort and sensitivity.</li>\r\n	<li>Battery Life: Check the battery life and consider having spare batteries on hand for extended use.</li>\r\n	<li>Health Conditions: Consult with a healthcare professional if you have any medical conditions or concerns before using a massager, especially if you experience chronic pain.</li>\r\n	<li>Safety: Avoid applying excessive pressure or using the massager for extended periods to prevent muscle strain or injury.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Please note that specific features and designs of mini massagers may vary among different brands and models. Always refer to the manufacturer&#39;s instructions for proper usage and maintenance of the specific product you choose.</p>', NULL, '923310242_pro_main_butterfly_mini_massager.webp', 'https://backend.droploo.com/product/images/923310242_pro_main_butterfly_mini_massager.webp', 'hot', 1, '2026-04-10 18:14:23', '2026-04-15 10:30:49', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"tel:01648177071\"><strong>Call Us:</strong>&nbsp;</a><a href=\"tel:+8801754177162\">+8801335157755</a></p>', NULL, 0, 1177, NULL, NULL, 5);
