(1550, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 50, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Portable Handheld Turbo Fan, 5 Gear Wind, Battery Operated', 'portable-handheld-turbo-fan,-5-gear-wind,-battery-operated', 100, 750.00, 485.00, 690.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Portable Handheld Turbo Fan, 5 Gear Wind, Battery Operated, Up to 12 Working Hours, Hand Fan with Air Turbo Tech</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ultimate Cooling Experience - This N607 handheld turbo fan adopts an advanced 6-blade design and is equipped with a high-speed three-phase brushless motor, with a maximum wind speed of up to 10m/s. Maximum speed is 13,550 rpm, which is 3 times that of ordinary handheld fans. Perfect for relieving the heat during hot journeys.<br />\r\n5 Gear Turbo Wind- Experience personalized comfort through the adjustable wind speed settings of the handheld personal fan. From light breezes to strong winds, we offer 5 wind speed settings that you can adjust to meet your specific cooling needs in any situation.<br />\r\nExtra Long Battery Life - The USB charging fan provides up to 12 hours of battery life, which compatible with regular USB ports, laptops, power , and car chargers, making it easy to have a seamless charging experience. Never worry about battery life again.<br />\r\nUnique Appearance - The ultra-small foldable body design and ultra-light weight of 190 grams allow you to easily put it in your pocket or bag, saying goodbye to bulky traditional fans and easily achieving mobile cooling. The pocket fan also comes with an anti-lost lanyard, so no matter where you go, this handheld portable turbo fan ensures you&#39;ll stay comfortable all day long.<br />\r\nPerfect Summer GIFT - The mini portable fan looks great and is suitable for men, women and children. It is widely used in work, study, travel and other scenarios. The small fan will become your cooling companion for travel and outdoor sports.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nColour:White<br />\r\nMaterial:plastic